{"path":"string/wide/wmemmove","title":"std::wmemmove","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>wmemmove","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/wide/wmemmove","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Copies exactly count successive wide characters from the wide character array pointed to by src to the wide character array pointed to by dest.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cwchar\">&lt;cwchar&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> wmemmove<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> dest, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> src, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> count <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Copies exactly <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code> successive wide characters from the wide character array pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">src</span></code> to the wide character array pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code> is zero, the function does nothing.\n</p><p>The arrays may overlap: copying takes place as if the wide characters were copied to a temporary wide character array and then copied from the temporary array to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dest\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the wide character array to copy to\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> src\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the wide character array to copy from\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> count\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> number of wide characters to copy\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Returns a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This function is not locale-sensitive and pays no attention to the values of the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span></span></code> objects it copies: nulls as well as invalid characters are copied too.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;clocale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwchar&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/setlocale\"><span class=\"kw2006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setlocale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\"><span class=\"kw2009\">LC_ALL</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1910\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> str<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"αβγδεζηθικλμνξοπρστυφχψω\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> str <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">wmemmove</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>str <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, str <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// copy from [δεζ] to [εζη]</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> str <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>αβγδεζηθικλμνξοπρστυφχψω\nαβγδδεζθικλμνξοπρστυφχψω</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wmemcpy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wmemcpy</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a certain amount of wide characters between two non-overlapping arrays <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/memmove\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>memmove</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  moves one buffer to another <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/copy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>copy</span><span>copy_if</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a range of elements to a new location <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/copy_backward\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>copy_backward</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a range of elements in backwards order <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/string/wide/wmemmove\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>wmemmove</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/wide","title":"Null-terminated wide strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::wmemmove","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Copies exactly count successive wide characters from the wide character array pointed to by src to the wide character…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"dest, src, count"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Returns a copy of dest."},{"label":"Notes","note":"This function is not locale-sensitive and pays no attention to the values of the wchar_t objects it copies: nulls as well as invalid characters are copied too."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also",